-- Textbook example scripts (dasinfobuch.de/skripte.html, the "DAR" templates).
--
-- The 2016 archive only contains scriptIDs up to 15670, so the 25 textbook
-- scripts with higher IDs are missing. This file restores exactly those 25 so
-- that every ID referenced by the textbook resolves via ?template=ID-XXXX.
--
-- The 9 textbook scripts already present in the archive (3761-3766, 3772, 3773,
-- 7439) are deliberately NOT touched here.
--
-- Format matches the SCRIPTS table: CRLF line endings, webFree = 1 (required for
-- public template access). INSERT IGNORE keeps this idempotent and prevents it
-- from overwriting rows a newer dump might already provide.

